               {
                "type": "null"
               }
              ],
              "description": "The average of this user's own anime scores, on AniList's 0-100 community scale. It stays 0-100 whatever the viewer's configured scoreFormat is, since that setting only changes how anilist.co displays scores. This is NOT the 0-10 scale a personal list-entry `score` uses."
             },
